<p>Sets the specified integer on the event.
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Event%20keyword" title="Event keyword">event</a> SetEventInteger(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Event%20keyword" title="Event keyword">event</a> evEvent,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> nIndex,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> nValue<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">evEvent<dd>The event to set the integer on<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nIndex<dd>The index of the integer to set<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nValue<dd>The value of the integer to set
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
<p><dd>Returns the modfied event, returns an invalid event on error.
</p>
</dl><dl><dt>Source:
<p><dd><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Script.ldf" title="Script.ldf">script.ldf</a>
</p>
</dl>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Sets the specified integer on the event.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>It should be noted that there is no maximum number of values on an event, as the array of values on the event expands as needed.
</p><p>The event returned is a new event. So, for example,
</p>
<pre>
event ev       = GetCurrentEvent();
event evEvent2 = Event(EVENT_TYPE_SPELLSCRIPT_AFTER_EFFECTS);

eEvent2 = SetEventInteger(evEvent2, 0, ABILITY_SPELL_BLIZZARD);
DelayEvent(1.0f, GetEventTarget(ev), evEvent2, "my_script");
</pre>
<p>will not work without the assignment in the third line. 
</p><p><br />
</p>
